Group 3 Game Name: Paws & Puddles
1. Game Concept
Overview & Genre: A 2D side-scrolling platformer where the player controls a feline protagonist navigating through a hazardous environment to locate an exit.
Inspiration: The core gameplay mechanics, hazard evasion, and power-up collection are directly inspired by Super Mario Bros.
Thematic Element: The game incorporates "The liquid cat" theme. The character can collect a special spell that transitions the cat into a fluid state, altering its physical properties to overcome specific obstacles.
